cff-version: 1.2.0
title: BH26 Collaboration Index
abstract: >-
  Self-introductions of BioHackathon 2026 participants in Matsuyama, indexed by
  research topic, programming language and skill. Curated by hand from the event
  self-introduction slide deck and published as a static site with JSON-LD
  serialisations. Data is CC0-1.0; the accompanying source code is MIT.
type: dataset
authors:
